  m_text: '<u>OTHER CREDITS</u>



    Painting featured in Puzzle #1 was created
    by Leonardo da Vinci.



    Riddles for Puzzle #3 were taken from all over the
    internet.



    The concept of deciphering a message through radio waves was
    taken from the TV Show "Pluribus" by Vince Gilligan.

'
